      "category": "Other",
      "description": "• Keep AltStore history optional and explain API compatibility changes\n• Publish separate public and Preview apps in AltStore, retain downloadable history and refine screen spacing\n• Keep compact dashboard sections in normal flow and bound the drink form on iPad\n• Build a native iPad interface with adaptive navigation, dashboard, map panes and game grids\n• Keep server configuration available while bundling native apps\n• Reserve a separate network budget for signed photo galleries\n• Add guest public browsing, bounded caches, shared-network quotas and iPad IPA checks\n• Fix stale map responses, removed crew selection and web screen remounts\n• Improve the bars map and social venue discovery\n• Bars map: my position dot and locate button; tapped bar shows ranking, my nights and photos\n• Button: no vertical padding, all buttons keep the same height; short labels fit on one line\n• Revert Button vertical padding: all buttons keep the same height, short labels fit on one line\n• Button: vertical padding so a two-line label is not tight against the border\n• Shorter label for withdrawing the health consent so it stays on one line\n• No-account dot: pink instead of cyan, which the anti-slop lint (D-09) refuses\n• Moi tab: a cyan dot while there is no account\n• Every screen needs the arrival flow first: direct URLs redirect to onboarding\n• Moi: guests get a row to create or open an account\n• Web: screen blocks rise in once, then drop their animated style\n• Web: no rise-in animation on screen blocks, it left blank holes after scrolling\n• Guests can create or open an account; sign-out asks to confirm and needs a password\n• Fix onboarding progress row overlapping the step title\n• Let guests into the app after onboarding: age is optional\n• Preview deployment",
